* '''Illaoi''' cannot spawn {{as|Tentacles|buzzword2}} on ally invulnerable {{tip|turrets|structures}} [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D8r_7zpD3tY] {{supNote|Added undocumented in 9.13}}, in addition to neither her nor the {{as|Vessel|buzzword3}} being able to spawn them in [[Nexus Obelisk|Nexus Obelisk's]] attack range.
** When the [[inhibitor]] is down, ''Nexus turrets'' will only have a single hardcoded valid space on each of their external sides to spawn {{as|Tentacles|buzzword2}} on. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xJ4Jwm7jhZ8] {{supNote|Added undocumented in 9.13. This may be intended to guarantee at least 2 Tentacles spawn around the Nexus without issues with the spawn density limit}}
* {{as|Tentacles|buzzword2}} are prevented from spawning on [[base gate]]s.
* If multiple {{as|Tentacles|buzzword2}} hit simultaneously, the received healing is calculated iteratively based on the new amount of '''missing''' health, as per this formula: {{as|('''maximum''' health{{minus}}'''current''' health)}}{{times}}(1{{minus}}0.95<sup>n</sup>), with 'n' the number of {{as|Tentacle|buzzword2}} hits.
** Because the healing is calculated iteratively, {{tip|Grievous Wounds}} ends up slightly less effective than its nominal value, since the reduced healing leaves more {{as|'''missing''' health}} on each subsequent {{as|Tentacle|buzzword2}} hit.
{{safesubst:unexpected|desc=
* A slam that extends the damage reduction window to reduce the damage of a successive slam that would otherwise not have been reduced, can have its contribution of damage effectivelly negated or even outweighted by the window extension. For example, a slam reduced to 25% damage may be the cause of a successive slam being reduced from 100% to 50% damage - reducing the damage by 50% with only a contribution of 25%. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0LZq1K93P40] [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GYSZiIaCleE] {{bug|2}}
** The expectation would instead be for slam damage to follow the formula (200%{{minus}}damage% of slams in the last {{fd|0.66s}}){{divided by}}2, which would result in the successive slam from the above example to be reduced from 100% to {{tt|{{ap|(200-25)/2}}%|(200%{{minus}}25%){{divided by}}2}} damage - reducing the damage by {{ap|100-(200-25)/2}}% with a contribution of 25%.|affectedEffects=Illaoi I|estimatedPatchOrigin=V5.23|<!--added automatically-->wikiUploadTimestamp=1772521429|<!--added automatically-->pagename=Template:Data Illaoi/Prophet of an Elder God
}}
